      "",
      "**1.** The topic sentence.",
      "",
      "**2.** But (or however, although).",
      "",
      "**3.** So (or therefore, as a result).",
      "",
      "**4.** One.",
      "",
      "**5.** A draft.",
      "",
      "**6.** Spelling, punctuation, grammar or capital letters.",
